The following source files are derivative works of Headroom:

  src/lib/headroom-engine/adaptive-sizer.ts
    Ported from: crates/headroom-core/src/transforms/adaptive_sizer.rs
    Algorithms: SimHash (4-gram MD5 bit-voting), Kneedle knee-detection,
    zlib-ratio validation, compute_optimal_k adaptive sizer.

  src/lib/headroom-engine/smart-crusher.ts
    Ported from: crates/headroom-core/src/transforms/smart_crusher/
    Algorithms: JSON array type classification, k-split (first/last/importance
    buckets with banker's rounding and BUG #4 fix), dict/string/number array
    crushers with error-keyword anchoring and stride-fill.

  src/lib/headroom-engine/log-compressor.ts
    Ported from: crates/headroom-core/src/transforms/log_compressor.rs
    Algorithms: Log format detection (pytest/npm/cargo/jest/make/generic),
    per-line level scoring (ERROR=1.0, WARN=0.5, INFO=0.1, DEBUG=0.0),
    stack-trace state machine, adaptive-budget selection.

  src/lib/headroom-engine/text-compressor.ts
    Ported from: crates/headroom-core/src/signals/keyword_detector.rs
                 crates/headroom-core/src/signals/line_importance.rs
    Algorithms: Keyword priority tiers (error=0.95, security=0.85,
    warning=0.75, importance=0.60, markdown=0.45). The 'token' exclusion
    from the security keyword set is a bug fix from the original source.

